        407.03271484375,
        272.7646179199219
      ],
      "text": "Table 3.1 by the GDG when reclassifying medicines for use in longer MDR-TB regimens, as shown in  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        276.0953369140625,
        419.7662048339844,
        286.5993347167969
      ],
      "text": "The values are the unadjusted risk ratios, as defined by the study investigators of Trial 213 by month 24. b",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
