        306.2784423828125,
        487.11273193359375,
        320.6334228515625
      ],
      "text": "PICO question 4–2018 (MDR/RR-TB, 2018) (number of agents likely to be effective)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        328.0923156738281,
        527.41015625,
        342.53533935546875
      ],
      "text": "Regarding PICO question 4–2018 (MDR/RR-TB, 2018), the analysis showed that in longer MDR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        341.29229736328125,
        527.2628173828125,
        355.7353210449219
      ],
      "text": "treatment regimens, the risk of treatment failure, relapse and death was comparable when the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        354.4923095703125,
        527.37841796875,
        368.9353332519531
      ],
      "text": "treatment started with four, five or six medicines that were likely to be effective. It also showed that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.6922912597656,
        527.3731079101562,
        382.13531494140625
      ],
      "text": "patients who took three agents in the continuation phase – the situation expected when starting with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993698120117188,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        380.8923034667969,
        527.3859252929688,
        395.3353271484375
      ],
      "text": "four agents and stopping the injectable agent at the end of the intensive phase – fared no worse",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        394.0923156738281,
        342.73114013671875,
        408.53533935546875
      ],
      "text": "than those who took four agents in the continuation phase.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        415.7962951660156,
        527.4004516601562,
        430.23931884765625
      ],
      "text": "Given that drug–drug interactions, pill burden and likelihood of AEs all increase with the number",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        428.9963073730469,
        527.38916015625,
        443.4393310546875
      ],
      "text": "of agents in a regimen, it would be desirable to give patients the minimum number of medicines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        442.1963195800781,
        527.427978515625,
        456.63934326171875
      ],
      "text": "necessary to obtain comparable levels of relapse-free cure. When deciding on the minimum number",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993398666381836,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        455.39630126953125,
        527.4344482421875,
        469.8393249511719
      ],
      "text": "of agents to recommend, the GDG 2018 considered analyses that included injectable agents in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        468.5963134765625,
        527.6011352539062,
        483.0393371582031
      ],
      "text": "regimens, while fully cognizant that future longer regimens are expected to be increasingly injectable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992297172546387,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        481.7962951660156,
        527.5460205078125,
        496.23931884765625
      ],
      "text": "free. Moreover, it was important to provide for situations in which more than one medicine is stopped",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98373794555664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        494.9963073730469,
        527.3837280273438,
        509.4393310546875
      ],
      "text": "at some point during treatment, either because of its indication for use – bedaquiline and delamanid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.9202880859375,
        527.4268798828125,
        522.6392822265625
      ],
      "text": "(80) Table 3.3 on-label use is 6 months – or because of tolerability (particularly linezolid;  )  ; hence,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3963012695312,
        527.4419555664062,
        535.8392944335938
      ],
      "text": "for most of its duration, the regimen would contain two key agents fewer than at the start. Although",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        534.5963134765625,
        527.4210205078125,
        549.039306640625
      ],
      "text": "bedaquiline use beyond 6 months is referred to as off-label use, new evidence on the safety profile",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        547.7962646484375,
        527.1378173828125,
        562.2392578125
      ],
      "text": "of bedaquiline use beyond 6 months was available to the GDG 2019. This evidence supports the safe",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995148658752441,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        560.996337890625,
        527.3958129882812,
        575.4393310546875
      ],
      "text": "use of bedaquiline beyond 6 months in patients who receive appropriate schedules of baseline and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        574.1962890625,
        527.4310302734375,
        588.6392822265625
      ],
      "text": "follow-up monitoring. The use of bedaquiline beyond 6 months continues to be off-label use; thus,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        587.396240234375,
        253.25167846679688,
        601.8392333984375
      ],
      "text": "best practices in off-label use still apply.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        609.1002197265625,
        527.433349609375,
        623.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "The 2018 IPD included experience from more than 300 patients who were treated with linezolid for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        622.3001708984375,
        527.36962890625,
        636.7431640625
      ],
      "text": "at least 1 month, mostly at a dose of 600 mg/day, with information on duration of use. About 30%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.5001831054688,
        527.4002075195312,
        649.9431762695312
      ],
      "text": "only received linezolid for 1–6 months, but more than 30% received it for more than 18 months,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.7001953125,
        527.3836059570312,
        663.1431884765625
      ],
      "text": "and these patients had the lowest frequency of treatment failure, LTFU and death. A plot of linezolid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.9002075195312,
        527.4287719726562,
        676.3432006835938
      ],
      "text": "duration and treatment failure suggests that the optimal duration of use would be about 20 months,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.1002197265625,
        527.4046630859375,
        689.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "corresponding to the usual total duration of a longer MDR-TB regimen. However, such an analysis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        688.3001708984375,
        527.5925903320312,
        702.7431640625
      ],
      "text": "does not account for survivorship bias, meaning that those who complete the full length of treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.985139846801758,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        701.5001831054688,
        527.4168090820312,
        715.9431762695312
      ],
      "text": "are more likely to have a successful outcome, given that deaths and losses to follow-up occur earlier.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        714.7001953125,
        527.3792114257812,
        729.1431884765625
      ],
      "text": "No clear pattern could be discerned for type of AE and duration of use, although a few cases were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        726.6242065429688,
        527.42236328125,
        742.3432006835938
      ],
      "text": "(81) reported with optic neuropathy, known to be associated with long-term use of linezolid  , whereas",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.993247985839844,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        741.1002197265625,
        375.3670959472656,
        755.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "haematological toxicity was reported regardless of duration of use.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
